<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;UNITED STATES SENATE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The United States Senate is the body that confirmed Cummings on multiple occasions and nominated him to various positions."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CUMMINGS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cummings is a person who served in various capacities including the United States Senate and the United States Court of Appeals for the Seventh Circuit."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNITED STATES COURT OF APPEALS FOR THE SEVENTH CIRCUIT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The United States Court of Appeals for the Seventh Circuit is the judicial body to which Cummings was appointed."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HARRY S. TRUMAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Harry S. Truman is a former U.S. president mentioned in the context of the transitional period between his and Eisenhower's presidencies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Harry S. Truman is a former U.S. president whose presidency ended before Cummings' term as a judge began."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DWIGHT D. EISENHOWER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dwight D. Eisenhower is a former U.S. president whose presidency began after Cummings' term as a judge started."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PRESIDENT LYNDON B. JOHNSON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"President Lyndon B. Johnson nominated Cummings to the United States Court of Appeals for the Seventh Circuit."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TANNAHILL V. LOCKNEY I.S.D.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tannahill v. Lockney I.S.D. is a case in which Cummings issued an opinion stating that mandatory whole school drug testing policies violate the 4th amendment."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PERSUADER RULE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Persuader Rule is a rule proposed by President Barack Obama that Cummings found unconstitutional and blocked with a permanent nationwide injunction."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;4TH AMENDMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The 4th amendment is part of the U.S. Constitution that protects against unreasonable searches and seizures."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FIRST AMENDMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The First Amendment is part of the U.S. Constitution that guarantees freedom of speech and other fundamental rights."&lt;SEP&gt;"The First Amendment is the constitutional right mentioned in the context of the Persuader Rule case."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TAFT-HARTLEY ACT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Taft-Hartley Act is a federal law that Cummings heard a case concerning the constitutionality of its emergency strike section."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Taft-Hartley Act is a federal law that restricts the activities of labor unions and sets rules for collective bargaining."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FLORIDA PRISON CAMP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Florida prison camp is a location where Cummings heard a case involving alleged violations of the civil rights of convicts."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DECEMBER 8, 1987&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DATE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"December 8, 1987 is the date when Cummings was confirmed by the United States Senate."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DECEMBER 9, 1987&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DATE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"December 9, 1987 is the date when Cummings received his commission."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DECEMBER 31, 2014&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DATE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"December 31, 2014 is the date when Cummings assumed senior status."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARCH 1, 2001&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DATE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"March 1, 2001 is the date when Cummings issued an opinion on Tannahill v. Lockney I.S.D."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NOVEMBER 16, 2016&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DATE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"November 16, 2016 is the date when Cummings issued a permanent nationwide injunction blocking the Persuader Rule."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNITED STATES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The United States is the country where Cummings served in various capacities including the United States Senate and the United States Court of Appeals for the Seventh Circuit."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SCHOOL DISTRICTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"School districts are the entities that Cummings addressed in his opinion on Tannahill v. Lockney I.S.D."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BARACK OBAMA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Barack Obama is the former U.S. president whose 'Persuader Rule' was blocked by Cummings."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUPREME COURT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Supreme Court is the highest judicial body mentioned in the context of Cummings' cases."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONVICTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Convicts are the subjects of the case Cummings heard concerning alleged violations of their civil rights in a Florida prison camp."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LABOR UNIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Labor unions are the entities mentioned in the context of the Taft-Hartley Act."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COLLECTIVE BARGAINING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Collective bargaining is a practice mentioned in the context of the Taft-Hartley Act."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EMERGENCY STRIKE SECTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The emergency strike section is a specific part of the Taft-Hartley Act that Cummings heard a case about."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FLORIDA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Florida is the state where the prison camp mentioned in the context of civil rights violations is located."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIONIZATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Unionization is the topic of the case Cummings heard concerning the constitutionality of the emergency strike section of the Taft-Hartley Act."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ATTORNEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An attorney is the type of professional mentioned in the context of the Persuader Rule case."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EMPLOYER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An employer is the type of professional mentioned in the context of the Persuader Rule case."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PUBLIC DISCLOSURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Public disclosure is the requirement mentioned in the context of the Persuader Rule case."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A union is the subject of the Persuader Rule case."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FOURTH AMENDMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Fourth Amendment is the constitutional right mentioned in the context of the Tannahill v. Lockney I.S.D. case."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WHOLE SCHOOL DRUG TESTING POLICY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Whole school drug testing policy is the issue mentioned in the context of the Tannahill v. Lockney I.S.D. case."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0134-f6bdabbe7d64</data>
    </node>
